<title>FINLAND: TURKISTUOTTAJAT SEES 96/97 EARNINGS DOWN.</title>
<headline>TURKISTUOTTAJAT SEES 96/97 EARNINGS DOWN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish fur auction house Turkistuottajat Oy said in a statement on Monday it expected earnings for the 12-month financial year to end-August 1997 to be clearly weaker than in its previous 13-month financial year.  </p>
<p>Turkistuottajat's profit before extraordinary items and tax was 85.8 million markka in July 1995-August 1996. --Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
